{{!
    @template local_la/components/report_toolbar

    Renders report search, filters, columns, insights, and synthetic-data controls.

    Classes required for JS:
    * .btn - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .btn-primary - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .d-none - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .dropdown - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .dropdown-menu - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .fa - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .form-check - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .form-control - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .la-report-columns-form - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .la-report-synthetic-metric - JavaScript selector hook.
    * .row - JavaScript selector hook.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-action="cancel-column-edit" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="column-settings" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="delete-column" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="edit-column" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="open-report-modal-link" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-action="save-column-edit" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-bs-auto-close="outside" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-bs-toggle="dropdown" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-column-key - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-fieldtype="group" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-fieldtype="submit" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-groupname="buttonar" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-insights-available - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-insights-message - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-method="local_la_get_columns" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-params - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-patterns-available - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-patterns-message - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-display" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-edit" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-enabled-input" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-handle" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-list" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-name-display" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="column-name-input" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="columns-cancel" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="filter-button-label" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="report-filters" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="report-filters-form" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="row-actions" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="synthetic-cancel" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="synthetic-custom-fields" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="synthetic-form" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-region="synthetic-preset" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-report-id - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-size="lg" - JavaScript data or selector hook.
    * data-title - JavaScript data or selector hook.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * has_search - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for has search.
    * action - string: URL for action.
    * search_hidden_params - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for search hidden params.
    * name - string: Text for name.
    * value - string: Text for value.
    * search_operator_name - string: Text for search operator name.
    * search_value_name - string: Text for search value name.
    * search_term - string: Text for search term.
    * search_name - string: Text for search name.
    * synthetic.enabled - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic enabled.
    * synthetic.available - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic available.
    * synthetic.unavailable_label - string: Text for synthetic unavailable label.
    * synthetic.label - string: Text for synthetic label.
    * synthetic.selected_label - bool: Whether synthetic selected label is enabled.
    * synthetic_hidden_params - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic hidden params.
    * synthetic.timesec_selected - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic timesec selected.
    * synthetic.metric_name - string: Text for synthetic metric name.
    * synthetic.visits_selected - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic visits selected.
    * synthetic.options - array: List of entries for synthetic options.
    * synthetic.preset_name - string: Text for synthetic preset name.
    * selected - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for selected.
    * label - string: Text for label.
    * synthetic.custom_selected - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic custom selected.
    * synthetic.from_name - string: Text for synthetic from name.
    * synthetic.from - string: Text for synthetic from.
    * synthetic.to_name - string: Text for synthetic to name.
    * synthetic.to - string: Text for synthetic to.
    * reportid - int: Numeric value for reportid.
    * insights_available - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for insights available.
    * patterns_available - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for patterns available.
    * insights_unavailable_label - string: Text for insights unavailable label.
    * patterns_unavailable_label - string: Text for patterns unavailable label.
    * can_share - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for can share.
    * has_columns - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for has columns.
    * columns - array: List of entries for columns.
    * key - string: Text for key.
    * enabled - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for enabled.
    * visible - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for visible.
    * can_manage - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for can manage.
    * column_add_params - string: Text for column add params.
    * has_filters - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for has filters.
    * show_filter_count - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for show filter count.
    * filter_count_label - string: Text for filter count label.
    * synthetic_current_params - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for synthetic current params.
    * visible_filters - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for visible filters.
    * has_hidden_filters - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for has hidden filters.
    * hidden_filters - array|bool: Section data or visibility flag for hidden filters.
    * reseturl - string: URL for reseturl.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "reportid": 1,
        "has_search": true,
        "search_name": "search",
        "search_term": "",
        "has_columns": true,
        "columns": [
            {
                "key": "name",
                "name": "Name",
                "visible": true
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3 mb-4">
    {{#has_search}}
        <form class="flex-shrink-0 la-report-search-form" role="search" action="{{action}}" method="get">
            {{#search_hidden_params}}
                <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
            {{/search_hidden_params}}
            <input type="hidden" name="{{search_operator_name}}" value="contains">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="la-report-search-term">{{#str}}search, core{{/str}}</label>
            <div class="input-group la-report-search-group">
                <input
                    id="la-report-search-term"
                    type="search"
                    name="{{search_value_name}}"
                    class="form-control"
                    value="{{search_term}}"
                    placeholder="{{search_name}}">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">{{#str}}search, core{{/str}}</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    {{/has_search}}

    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 la-report-toolbar-actions">
        {{#synthetic.enabled}}
            <div class="dropdown">
                {{^synthetic.available}}
                <span title="{{synthetic.unavailable_label}}" class="d-inline-block">
                {{/synthetic.available}}
                <button
                    type="button"
                    class="btn btn-secondary{{^synthetic.available}} disabled{{/synthetic.available}}"
                    {{#synthetic.available}}data-toggle="dropdown"{{/synthetic.available}}
                    {{^synthetic.available}}disabled{{/synthetic.available}}
                    aria-expanded="false">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar me-2"></i>{{synthetic.label}}: {{synthetic.selected_label}}
                </button>
                {{^synthetic.available}}
                </span>
                {{/synthetic.available}}
                {{#synthetic.available}}
                <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dropdown-menu-right moodle-has-zindex p-0 la-report-synthetic-dropdown">
                    <form autocomplete="off" action="{{action}}" method="get" class="la-report-synthetic-form" data-region="synthetic-form">
                        {{#synthetic_hidden_params}}
                            <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
                        {{/synthetic_hidden_params}}
                        <div class="la-report-synthetic-body px-3 py-3">
                            <div class="la-report-synthetic-metric mb-3" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Synthetic column value">
                                <label class="la-report-synthetic-metric-option{{#synthetic.timesec_selected}} active{{/synthetic.timesec_selected}}">
                                    <input
                                        class="visually-hidden"
                                        type="radio"
                                        name="{{synthetic.metric_name}}"
                                        value="timesec"
                                        {{#synthetic.timesec_selected}}checked{{/synthetic.timesec_selected}}>
                                    <span>Learning time</span>
                                </label>
                                <label class="la-report-synthetic-metric-option{{#synthetic.visits_selected}} active{{/synthetic.visits_selected}}">
                                    <input
                                        class="visually-hidden"
                                        type="radio"
                                        name="{{synthetic.metric_name}}"
                                        value="visits"
                                        {{#synthetic.visits_selected}}checked{{/synthetic.visits_selected}}>
                                    <span>Visits</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>

                            {{#synthetic.options}}
                                <label class="form-check d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                                    <input
                                        class="form-check-input mt-0"
                                        type="radio"
                                        name="{{synthetic.preset_name}}"
                                        value="{{value}}"
                                        data-region="synthetic-preset"
                                        {{#selected}}checked{{/selected}}>
                                    <span>{{label}}</span>
                                </label>
                            {{/synthetic.options}}

                            <div class="la-report-synthetic-custom{{^synthetic.custom_selected}} d-none{{/synthetic.custom_selected}}" data-region="synthetic-custom-fields">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="form-label small text-muted mb-1">From</label>
                                    <input type="date" class="form-control" name="{{synthetic.from_name}}" value="{{synthetic.from}}">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="form-label small text-muted mb-1">To</label>
                                    <input type="date" class="form-control" name="{{synthetic.to_name}}" value="{{synthetic.to}}">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="la-report-synthetic-footer px-3 py-3">
                            <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" value="{{#str}}apply, core{{/str}}">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link ms-1" data-region="synthetic-cancel">{{#str}}cancel, core{{/str}}</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
                {{/synthetic.available}}
            </div>
        {{/synthetic.enabled}}

        <div class="d-flex align-items-stretch la-report-view-controls">
        <div class="dropdown">
            <select
                class="form-select"
                data-region="row-actions"
                data-report-id="{{reportid}}"
                data-insights-available="{{#insights_available}}1{{/insights_available}}{{^insights_available}}0{{/insights_available}}"
                data-patterns-available="{{#patterns_available}}1{{/patterns_available}}{{^patterns_available}}0{{/patterns_available}}"
                data-insights-message="{{insights_unavailable_label}}"
                data-patterns-message="{{patterns_unavailable_label}}"
                aria-label="{{#str}}chooserows, local_la{{/str}}">
                <option value="" selected>{{#str}}chooserows, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                <optgroup label="{{#str}}general, core{{/str}}">
                    <option value="print">{{#str}}print, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                    {{#can_share}}
                        <option value="share">{{#str}}share, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                    {{/can_share}}
                    <option value="highlight">{{#str}}highlight, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                </optgroup>
                <optgroup label="{{#str}}aitools, local_la{{/str}}">
                    <option value="userstory">{{#str}}summarizeinsights, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                    <option value="analyze">{{#str}}findpatterns, local_la{{/str}}</option>
                </optgroup>
            </select>
        </div>
        {{#has_columns}}
            <div class="dropdown">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-table-columns me-2"></i>{{#str}}columns, local_la{{/str}}
                </button>
                <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dropdown-menu-right moodle-has-zindex p-0 la-report-columns-dropdown">
                    <form autocomplete="off" class="la-report-columns-form">
                        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{reportid}}">
                        <div class="la-report-columns-body">
                            <div class="px-3 py-3" data-region="column-list">
                                {{#columns}}
                                    <div class="la-report-column-item" data-column-key="{{key}}" draggable="true">
                                        <input type="hidden" name="columns[{{key}}][enabled]" value="{{#enabled}}1{{/enabled}}{{^enabled}}0{{/enabled}}" data-region="column-enabled-input">
                                        <button type="button" class="la-report-column-handle btn btn-link p-0" data-region="column-handle" aria-label="{{#str}}move, core{{/str}}">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-border-none" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        </button>
                                        <div class="la-report-column-content flex-grow-1">
                                            <label class="form-check d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-0 la-report-column-display" data-region="column-display">
                                                <input class="form-check-input mt-0" type="checkbox" name="columns[{{key}}][visible]" value="1"{{#visible}} checked{{/visible}}>
                                                <span data-region="column-name-display">{{name}}</span>
                                            </label>
                                            {{#can_manage}}
                                                <div class="la-report-column-edit d-none" data-region="column-edit">
                                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                                        <input
                                                            type="text"
                                                            class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                                            name="columns[{{key}}][name]"
                                                            value="{{name}}"
                                                            data-region="column-name-input">
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm px-0" data-action="cancel-column-edit">{{#str}}cancel, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-action="save-column-edit">{{#str}}save, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            {{/can_manage}}
                                        </div>
                                        {{#can_manage}}
                                            <div class="dropdown">
                                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 la-report-column-menu-trigger" data-action="toggle-column-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="{{#str}}actions, core{{/str}}">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-ellipsis-vertical" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                </button>
                                                <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dropdown-menu-right">
                                                    <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="edit-column">{{#str}}editcolumnname, local_la{{/str}}</button>
                                                    <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="column-settings">{{#str}}settings, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                    <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="delete-column">{{#str}}delete, core{{/str}}</button>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        {{/can_manage}}
                                    </div>
                                {{/columns}}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="la-report-columns-footer px-3 py-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" value="{{#str}}apply, core{{/str}}">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-link ms-1" data-region="columns-cancel">{{#str}}cancel, core{{/str}}</button>
                            </div>
                            {{#can_manage}}
                                <a
                                    href="#"
                                    class="btn-link ms-auto"
                                    data-action="open-report-modal-link"
                                    data-method="local_la_get_columns"
                                    data-size="lg"
                                    data-params='{{column_add_params}}'
                                    data-title="{{#str}}columnbank, local_la{{/str}}"
                                ><i class="fa-solid fa-lines-leaning"></i> {{#str}}columnbank, local_la{{/str}}</a>
                            {{/can_manage}}
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        {{/has_columns}}

        {{#has_filters}}
            <div class="dropdown">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary position-relative" type="button" id="la-report-filters-button" data-toggle="dropdown" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" title="{{#str}}filters, core{{/str}}">
                    <i class="icon fa fa-filter fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span data-region="filter-button-label">{{#str}}filters, core{{/str}}</span>
                    {{#show_filter_count}}
                        <span class="la-report-filter-badge">{{filter_count_label}}</span>
                    {{/show_filter_count}}
                </button>
                <div class="filters-dropdown la-report-filters-dropdown dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end dropdown-menu-right moodle-has-zindex p-0" aria-labelledby="la-report-filters-button">
                    <div class="reportbuilder-filters-sidebar scroll-shadow" data-region="report-filters">
                        <div class="px-3 pt-3">
                            <div class="reportbuilder-filters-wrapper" data-region="report-filters-form">
                                <form autocomplete="off" action="{{action}}" method="get" accept-charset="utf-8" class="mform full-width-labels">
                                    <div>
                                        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{reportid}}">
                                        <input type="hidden" name="tab" value="view">
                                        {{#synthetic_current_params}}
                                            <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
                                        {{/synthetic_current_params}}
                                    </div>
                                    {{#visible_filters}}
                                        {{> local_la/components/report_filter_item }}
                                    {{/visible_filters}}
                                    {{#has_hidden_filters}}
                                        <div class="la-report-filter-section-title">{{#str}}hiddenfilters, local_la{{/str}}</div>
                                        {{#hidden_filters}}
                                            {{> local_la/components/report_filter_item }}
                                        {{/hidden_filters}}
                                    {{/has_hidden_filters}}
                                    <div class="mb-3 row fitem la-report-filters-actions" data-groupname="buttonar">
                                        <div class="col-md-12 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center felement" data-fieldtype="group">
                                            <fieldset class="w-100 m-0 p-0 border-0">
                                                <legend class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}filters, core{{/str}}</legend>
                                                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center">
                                                    <div class="fitem">
                                                        <span data-fieldtype="submit">
                                                            <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" value="{{#str}}applyfilters, local_la{{/str}}">
                                                        </span>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="fitem">
                                                        <a href="{{reseturl}}" class="btn btn-link ms-1">{{#str}}resetallfilters, local_la{{/str}}</a>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </fieldset>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        {{/has_filters}}

        </div>

    </div>
</div>
